ow what's causing  this error see if you can  find out a fix to it and and think about  whether that fix  tells you anything about how ggplot2  works  um for the purposes of the slide i've  not included the full code  um on this on the on the display  but if you want to see the um the full  code for this plot  as well as all of the other  visualizations that were included in  this talk  have a look at this url and thank you so  much for tuning in  good luck with your future gigi plots  and i hope that you have enjoyed the  [Music]  talk

